---
import ContactCTA from "../components/ContactCTA.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Jeanine White"
  description="About Jeanine White Lorem Ipsum"
>
  <div class="stack gap-20">
    <main class="wrapper about">
      <div class="about-body">
        <Hero title="About" tagline="">
          <img
            width="1553"
            height="873"
            src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dhytwf10i/image/upload/c_fill,g_center,h_873,w_1553/v1778422552/storm-troopers-sitting_vcjqzr.png"
            alt="Jeanine White at work with a colleague"
          />
        </Hero>

        <section>
          <div class="content">
            <p>
              I started my journey as a photographer in 2026 when I bought my
              first camera. I was looking for a way to express my creative side
              and photography sounded like a great way to do that. I chose
              action figures as my subject because I've been collecting since
              about 2022 and it was a perfect fit for my hobby.
            </p>
            <p>
              While action figures are my primary subject, I'm also interested
              in other areas like landscapes, sports, music, and food. I'm not
              sure where my hobby will take me, but I'm excited to share my art
              and connect with others who have similar interests.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <ContactCTA />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.5rem;
  }

  /* Same column width as work markdown: image + prose share 65ch */
  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-body img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--gray-200);
  }

  .content > * + * {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .content :global(a) {
    text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
    transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
  }

  .content :global(a:hover),
  .content :global(a:focus) {
    text-decoration-color: currentColor;
  }

  @media (min-width: 50em) {
    .about-body {
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-body > section {
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
    }
  }
</style>
